p('Ontario guidance requires retention of specified employee, hours and wage records. Some cited wage/time records have three-year requirements; do not apply a single three-year rule to every company record. Build a record-category retention schedule for each applicable jurisdiction, including policy versions and legally required holds.')
p('Policy status: draft for company adoption. The employee-duty catalog covers current admin/marketing roles. Other departments, clinical duties and jurisdiction-specific compensation require separate definitions. Source artifacts: foundation-seed.json, the governance registry/export and the non-deployed WorkAccountability evaluator.')
p('Validation result: 65 unique duty templates, 11 existing roles, 12 passing foundation tests, zero actual employee assignments and no new public API or live payroll/deployment change.')
